ant_Immunity.png/28px-Radiant_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Radiant_Immunity.png/42px-Radiant_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Radiant_Immunity.png/56px-Radiant_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Radiant_Immunity.png/28px-Radiant_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Radiant_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Force_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Force_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Force_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Force_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Force_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Force_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Force_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Force_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Force_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Additional Resources</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resources\" data-item-name=\"resources\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png/36px-1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png/54px-1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png 2x\"><img alt=\"1 Level 1 Spell Slots.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png/36px-1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/1_Level_1_Spell_Slots.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Kobold Hole</b> is a special combat entity that spawns Kobolds (Inventors, Scouts, and regular Kobolds) for 5 turns.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Kobold Holes are only found if the party enters combat with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/25px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/38px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/50px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bugthimble\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png/25px-Portrait_Bugthimble.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Portrait_Bugthimble.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bugthimble\" title=\"Bugthimble\">Bugthimble</a>. He calls his friends, using the kobold holes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Combat\">Combat</span></h2>\n<p>Spawns a Kobold every turn, for 5 turns, provided the hole isn't blocked. If an object of sufficient weight is standing on top of the hole, it will receive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blocked_Warrens_(Condition)\" title=\"Blocked Warrens (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blocked Warrens\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Generic_Info_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blocked_Warrens_(Condition)\" title=\"Blocked Warrens (Condition)\">Blocked Warrens</a>. If not, the hole will have the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Open_Warrens_(Condition)\" title=\"Open Warrens (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Open Warrens\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Generic_Summon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Warrens_(Condition)\" title=\"Open Warrens (Condition)\">Open Warrens</a> to signify that it will spawn a kobold.\n</p><p>Kobold holes can be targeted by attacks and permanently closed by dealing 26 damage to it and destroy it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_locations\">Related locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Graveyard_(Lower_City)\" title=\"Graveyard (Lower City)\">Graveyard (Lower City)</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715013331\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.129 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5260/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44034/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18151/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11829/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.031/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1069219/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  120.648      1 -total\n 85.34%  102.958      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 57.43%   69.286      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 25.07%   30.244      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.05%   12.120      1 Template:Template_style\n  7.97%    9.614     30 Template:Trim\n  6.79%    8.188      2 Template:Cond\n  5.78%    6.971    